<title>Indonesia: Darya-Varia says 96 net at 23.58 bln rph vs 15.86 bln rph.</title>
<headline>Darya-Varia says 96 net at 23.58 bln rph vs 15.86 bln rph.</headline>
<dateline>JAKARTA 1997-03-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Full year to Dec 31, 1996</p>
<p>		    (in billion rupiah unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit			   23.58 vs 15.86</p>
<p>    Earnings per share  (rupiah)     176 vs 127</p>
<p>    Net sales			   203.24 vs 136.32</p>
<p>    Operating profit		   48.30 vs  33.03</p>
<p>    Pre-tax profit		     32.50 vs  25.01</p>
<p>    Retained earnings		  37.15 vs  19.87</p>
<p>Note: PT Darya-Varia Laboratoria is among Indonesia's large pharmaceutical firms.</p>
</text>
